Bitloom elaborate and emit tools (crates.io: bitloom). Unrelated to samitbasu/rhdl.

Usage: cargo-bitloom <COMMAND>

Commands:
  build        Elaborate a design package's `rhdl_elaborate()` and write Yosys-friendly Verilog
  new          Scaffold a minimal design crate depending only on `bitloom-prelude`
  firtool      Manage the pinned CIRCT firtool binary (AD-9 / NFR3)
  external-ip  Lock, verify, and replay an immutable external RTL source closure (FR199)
  sim-engines  List `bitloom-sim` tick engines (FR32). Simulation itself lives in tests / bitloom-sim
  hls          Product HLS: external Bambu (FR35) or in-tree schedule MVP (FR95 / AD-25)
  import       Import FIRRTL 6.0.0 `.fir` (Chisel→firtool output ok) into the same emit path as `build` (FR40 / FR46)
  gen-func     Generate a Rust functional-sim crate from a design package's FrozenHir (FR47 leg 1)
  gen-cycle    Generate a cycle-accurate tick-wrapper crate from FrozenHir (FR47 leg 2)
  gen-tlm      Generate SystemC TLM-2.0 LT C++ fixture from FrozenHir (FR101). Not Rust FL
  gen-tlm-at   Generate SystemC TLM-2.0 AT-subset C++ fixture from FrozenHir (FR107). Parallel to gen-tlm
  visualize    Emit module hierarchy HTML from a FIRRTL 6.0.0 `.fir` (FR38 / FR49 / FR40)
  doc          Alias of `visualize` — hierarchy HTML docs from FrozenHir (FR40 `doc`)
  wave         Tick a `.fir` design, dump VCD, timing HTML (FR38/49), interactive wave (FR104), typed IDE wave (FR117 subset B), and **by default** FR162 primary Tywaves GUI depth (FR134-level `tywaves.gui.*` + FR125 sidecar). Opt out with `--no-tywaves-gui`
  coverage     Tick a Mux demo (or `.fir`) and write FR114 `coverage.lcov` + `coverage.html`
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

